+    w83697hf	8	2	2	2	0x60	0x5ca3	no	yes(LPC)
+
+    For other winbond chips, and for i2c support in the above chips,
+    use w83781d.c.
+
+    Note: automatic ("cruise") fan control for 697, 637 & 627thf not
+    supported yet.
+*/
+
